  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth (Supabase)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (password grant) — guarda access_token",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{supabase_anon_key}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{supabase_url}}/auth/v1/token?grant_type=password",
              "host": ["{{supabase_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "v1", "token"],
              "query": [{ "key": "grant_type", "value": "password" }]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{test_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{test_password}}\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Login directo contra o Supabase Auth (nao e' um endpoint do backend). Preenche a variavel de colecao test_password antes de correr. O script em Tests guarda o access_token devolvido na variavel de colecao access_token, usada como Bearer em todos os outros pedidos desta colecao."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (body.access_token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', body.access_token);",
                  "    console.log('access_token guardado (' + body.access_token.length + ' chars)');",
                  "} else {",
                  "    console.warn('Sem access_token na resposta — confere test_email/test_password.');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Register (backend) — cria perfil apos signup Supabase",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "register"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Utilizador Teste\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Chamado depois do signup no Supabase Auth (o utilizador ja tem de ter sessao — usa o access_token do signup como Bearer). Corpo opcional (so 'name')."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
